  "summary": "Malicious code in my-auto-follow (npm)",
  "details": "My-auto-follow@1.0.0 is a WhatsApp Web (Baileys) library fork whose install/require triggers network egress and which depends on known-malicious cache packages (@cacheable/node-cache, cache-manager). The package pulls in these malicious dependencies and makes outbound network connections during installation/execution, behaviour consistent with a beacon/C2 channel. Installers should treat the package and its dependency chain as compromised.",
